iteria. With this project you'll explore the three different architectures (AlexNet, VGG, and ResNet).","topics":[],"score":246291,"global_rank":72071,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":14146},{"name":"baliga-lab/Scanlag","owner":"baliga-lab","html_url":"https://github.com/baliga-lab/Scanlag","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":11,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Analyzer for scanlag data","topics":[],"score":246290,"global_rank":72072,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":14147},{"name":"Karthikram398/Smart_selfie","owner":"Karthikram398","html_url":"https://github.com/Karthikram398/Smart_selfie","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":246286,"global_rank":72078,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":14148},{"name":"rocket3989/ieeextreme14","owner":"rocket3989","html_url":"https://github.com/rocket3989/ieeextreme14","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"CUC Bat Knights' Solutions for ieeextreme 14","topics":[],"score":246286,"global_rank":72079,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":14149},{"name":"markwal/OctoPrint-RepRapPro","owner":"markwal","html_url":"https://github.com/markwal/OctoPrint-RepRapPro","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":4,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Customizes OctoPrint to work with the RepRapPro firmware, in particular, the [dc42](https://github.com/dc42/RepRapFirmware) fork.","topics":[],"score":246284,"global_rank":72085,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":14150}]